---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Home | McGill Math Seminar">
	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero-content">
			<div class="badge">A Bi-Weekly Math Discussion</div>
			<h1>Where deep curiosity meets <span class="whimsical-text">playful exploration.</span></h1>
			<p class="hero-subtitle">
				We bridge rigorous, research-level math concepts with wonder, curiosity, and absolute confusion. No rigid curricula, just pure discussion-based fun.
			</p>
			<div class="hero-actions">
				<a href="#seminars" class="btn primary">See What's Coming Up</a>
				<a href="#about" class="btn secondary">Our Concept</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<div class="container">
		<section id="seminars" class="section">
			<div class="section-header">
				<h2 class="section-title">The Fall Schedule</h2>
				<p class="section-desc">Drop in whenever you like. Sessions are held (tentatively) Fridays in Burnside Hall GIC 512.</p>
			</div>
			
			<div class="grid">
				<div class="card event-card">
					<div class="date-tag">Nov 06</div>
					<h3>Introduction to Math Seminar</h3>
					<span class="speaker-tag">with Emily Forbrigger</span>
					<p class="card-text">Discover what math seminar is all about! Emily will give a sneak peak into what a speaker intro can look like, and then we'll have a rapid fire group discussion.</p>
					<div class="location-footer">Burnside, GIC 512 &bull; 10-11 AM</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card event-card">
					<div class="date-tag">Nov ??</div>
					<h3>To Be Decided!</h3>
					<span class="speaker-tag">with A. Speaker</span>
					<p class="card-text">Who knows the wonders we'll discuss! Maybe you'll be the speaker...?</p>
					<div class="location-footer">Burnside, GIC 512 &bull; 10-11 AM</div>
				</div>

				<div class="card event-card">
					<div class="date-tag">Nov ??</div>
					<h3>To Be Decided!</h3>
					<span class="speaker-tag">with A. Speaker</span>
					<p class="card-text">Who knows the wonders we'll discuss! Maybe you'll be the speaker...?</p>
					<div class="location-footer">Burnside, GIC 512 &bull; 10-11 AM</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section id="about" class="about-block">
			<div class="about-layout">
				<div class="about-text-content">
					<h2 class="section-title left">What is the Math Circle?</h2>
					<p class="paragraph">
						The focus of seminar is to develop curiosity about several types of math and learn how to explore them from new perspectives.
                    </p>
                    <p class="paragraph">Each seminar will contain…</p>
                    <ul class="main-list">
                        <li>SNACKS! Cookies/biscuits/something…</li>
                        <li>DRINKS! Tea, coffee…</li>
                        <li>One (or two) topics of discussion - that are niche math/physics/computer science/etc. related</li>
                        <li>A speaker (or two) who will lead thse discussions with activities/PPTs/straight up chitter-chatter</li>
                        <li>CURIOSITY! DISCOVERY! ACTIVE PARTICIPATION! CONFUSION! and….. MATH!!!!</li>
                    </ul>
				</div>
				<div class="info-sidebar">
					<div class="info-sticky-note">
						<h4>The Essentials</h4>
						<ul>
							<li><strong>When:</strong> Every other Friday (eventually)</li>
							<li><strong>Hours:</strong> 10:00 AM – 11:00 AM</li>
							<li><strong>Who:</strong> Open to ALL McGill students/faculty</li>
                            <li><strong>Sign Up:</strong> Just show up!</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .main-list {
    padding-left: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .inner-list {
    padding-left: 2.5rem;
    }

	.container {
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 2rem;
	}

	.section {
		padding: 5rem 0;
	}

	.section-header {
		margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
	}

	.section-title {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--text-dark);
		letter-spacing: -0.5px;
	}

	.section-title.left {
		text-align: left;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.section-desc, .newsletter-desc {
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--text-dark);
		font-weight: 500;
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.hero {
		padding: 6rem 2rem;
		background-color: var(--bg-cream);
		border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-ink);
		text-align: center;
	}

	.hero-content {
		max-width: 760px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.badge {
		display: inline-block;
		background-color: var(--bg-pure);
		border: 2px solid var(--border-ink);
		color: var(--text-dark);
		padding: 0.4rem 1.1rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.5px;
	}

	.hero h1 {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 3.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.2;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		color: var(--text-dark);
		letter-spacing: -1px;
	}

	.whimsical-text {
		color: var(--mcgill-red);
		font-style: italic;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.hero-subtitle {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: var(--text-dark);
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}

	.hero-actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.2rem;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.btn {
		padding: 0.8rem 1.8rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 1rem;
		border: 2px solid var(--border-ink);
		transition: all 0.15s ease;
	}

	.btn.primary {
		background-color: var(--mcgill-red);
		color: var(--bg-pure);
		box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--border-ink);
	}

	.btn.primary:hover {
		transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
		box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px var(--border-ink);
	}

	.btn.secondary {
		background-color: var(--bg-pure);
		color: var(--text-dark);
		box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--border-ink);
	}

	.btn.secondary:hover {
		transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
		box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px var(--border-ink);
	}

	.grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 2.5rem;
	}

	.card {
		background-color: var(--bg-pure);
		border: 2px solid var(--border-ink);
		border-radius: 6px;
		padding: 2rem;
		position: relative;
		box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--border-ink);
		transition: all 0.15s ease;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
	}

	.card:hover {
		transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
		box-shadow: 6px 6px 0px var(--mcgill-red);
	}

	.date-tag {
		background-color: var(--accent-pink);
		color: var(--dark-red);
		border: 2px solid var(--mcgill-red);
		display: inline-block;
		align-self: flex-start;
		padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		border-radius: 4px;
		margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
	}

	.card h3 {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 1.4rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
		color: var(--text-dark);
	}

	.speaker-tag {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--dark-red);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-style: italic;
		margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
		display: block;
	}

	.card-text {
		color: var(--text-dark);
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		flex-grow: 1;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.location-footer {
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.5px;
		color: var(--text-dark);
		border-top: 2px dashed var(--border-ink);
		padding-top: 1rem;
	}

	.about-block {
		background-color: var(--bg-pure);
		border: 2px solid var(--border-ink);
		border-radius: 8px;
		padding: 4rem 3rem;
		margin: 4rem 0;
	}

	.about-layout {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
		gap: 4rem;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.paragraph {
		color: var(--text-dark);
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.info-sidebar {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.info-sticky-note {
		background-color: var(--accent-pink);
		border: 2px dashed var(--mcgill-red);
		border-radius: 6px;
		padding: 2rem;
		width: 100%;
		transform: rotate(1deg);
	}

	.info-sticky-note h4 {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		color: var(--dark-red);
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.info-sticky-note ul {
		list-style: none;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.8rem;
	}

	.info-sticky-note li {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--text-dark);
	}

	.newsletter-block {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 5rem 2rem;
		background-color: var(--accent-pink);
		border: 2px solid var(--border-ink);
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin: 4rem 0 2rem 0;
	}

	.newsletter-block h2 {
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: 2.2rem;
		color: var(--text-dark);
		margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
	}

	.newsletter-block p {
		color: var(--text-dark);
		max-width: 540px;
		margin: 0 auto 2rem auto;
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.signup-form {
		display: flex;
		max-width: 460px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		gap: 0.5rem;
	}

	.signup-form input {
		flex: 1;
		background-color: var(--bg-pure);
		border: 2px solid var(--border-ink);
		padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		color: var(--text-dark);
		font-family: inherit;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	.signup-form input:focus {
		outline: none;
		border-color: var(--mcgill-red);
	}

	.signup-form button {
		background-color: var(--mcgill-red);
		color: var(--bg-pure);
		border: 2px solid var(--border-ink);
		padding: 0.8rem 1.4rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		border-radius: 4px;
		cursor: pointer;
		box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px var(--border-ink);
		transition: all 0.1s ease;
	}

	.signup-form button:hover {
		transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
		box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--border-ink);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.hero h1 {
			font-size: 2.6rem;
		}
		.about-layout {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2.5rem;
		}
		.about-block {
			padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
		}
		.signup-form {
			flex-direction: column;
		}
		.info-sticky-note {
			transform: none;
		}
	}
</style>
